# Decision Policy

## Phase 1 — Structured Bootstrap (iterations 0–5)

The first six iterations follow a fixed data-then-confirm pattern regardless of audit state.
This ensures the agent grounds its understanding in real data before making any dynamic decisions.

| Iteration | Required Action     |
|-----------|---------------------|
| 0         | data_interaction    |
| 1         | user_interaction    |
| 2         | data_interaction    |
| 3         | user_interaction    |
| 4         | data_interaction    |
| 5         | user_interaction    |

**The Phase 1 schedule is a hard constraint and OVERRIDES everything else.**

{% if current_iteration <= 5 %}
